\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 0]
Show only the newest N events (0 shows the full log)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the event records as JSON instead of the human view
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

