Diff the environment's work against its pinned base
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS SYNOPSIS
\fBdiff\fR [\fB\-\-stat\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
