\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAMES\fR>
Two or more environment names
.SH "H5I BOX EXPORT"
The output gate: freeze the box and write an inspectable bundle (patch.diff, report.md, receipt.json) for a human to review and apply. Nothing reaches the host repository without that human step
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS SYNOPSIS
